,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI斥资逾200亿美元采购Cerebras算力并拟获最高10%股权</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布生命科学模型GPT-Rosalind，深度赋能药物研发与蛋白质工程</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">ChatGPT女性用户占比首超50%且总用户规模逼近10亿大关</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌Gemini接入Google Photos，支持调用个人相片生成个性化图像</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌宣布旗下AI助手Gemini正式支持连接用户个人相片库，通过开启Personal Intelligence功能，系统可整合谷歌应用数据以提供更具个性化的交互体验。此次更新的核心在于打通了私人影像与AI生成能力之间的壁垒，配合图像生成工具Nano Banana，Gemini无需用户手动上传即可直接调取Google Photos中的私人相片进行创作。用户可直接要求系统生成包含特定人物或场景的个性化图像，例如生成与家人参与某项活动的动画风格图片。这一功能升级标志着AI图像生成从泛化模型应用正式迈向真正意义上的个人化，通过深度整合用户私有数据，显著提升了AI助手在处理个性化视觉任务时的效率与精准度，为用户提供了更具定制化的创作体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布3D场景生成系统Lyra2.0，单照可构建90米高连贯虚拟环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/05507a6a0bc7555d5306882a7c31fc5d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达研究团队于2026年4月16日发布3D场景生成系统Lyra2.0，该技术支持通过单张照片构建延伸范围达90米的3D环境，有效解决了长距离相机路径下的图像失真与误差累积难题。技术上，Lyra2.0通过实时存储3D几何信息确保环境一致性，并引入缺陷数据训练以增强模型的自我纠偏能力。基准测试显示，其在图像质量与相机控制维度优于GEN3C、Yume-1.5等六款竞品，快速版本生成效率提升13倍。目前，Lyra2.0已实现与Nvidia Isaac Sim物理引擎的无缝衔接，生成的3D场景可直接导出为网格模型。这一闭环流程显著降低了具身智能训练对现实世界3D数据采集的依赖，为自动驾驶及通用机器人（AGI）的物理感知训练提供了高效的仿真基础设施。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI斥资逾200亿美元采购Cerebras算力并拟获最高10%股权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已同意在未来三年内向芯片初创公司Cerebras支付逾200亿美元，用于购买其芯片驱动的服务器算力，并计划通过认股权证获得最高10%的股权。此次交易除算力采购外，OpenAI还将提供约10亿美元资助Cerebras开发数据中心，若计入此前1月签署的100亿美元算力协议，OpenAI未来三年总支出或达300亿美元。Cerebras以晶圆级引擎芯片技术闻名，正筹备于今年二季度上市，并计划下月完成30亿美元融资，届时估值预计达350亿美元。此次深度绑定不仅为Cerebras的IPO提供了核心支撑，也反映出OpenAI在推理算力需求激增背景下，正通过大规模资本投入与硬件厂商建立紧密的战略协同，以保障其底层算力基础设施的稳定供应。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布生命科学模型GPT-Rosalind，深度赋能药物研发与蛋白质工程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5d9bbadad0955c8f71f85b739f070c20.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于4月16日正式发布专为生命科学领域打造的AI模型GPT-Rosalind，旨在通过生成式AI加速药物研发流程。该模型针对基因组学和化学领域进行深度微调，在LABBench2等科学基准测试中表现优异，部分预测任务已展现出超越人类专家的潜力。GPT-Rosalind可协助科研人员完成证据合成、假设生成、实验规划及蛋白质工程分析。目前，该模型已作为“研究预览”向安进、莫德纳、赛默飞世尔及艾伦研究所等首批合作伙伴开放。OpenAI同步推出配套生命科学插件，支持链接超过50种专业科学工具与数据库。此举标志着OpenAI正式切入科学AI赛道，将AI能力从通用聊天工具拓展至科研基础设施，引发医药行业对AI辅助新药开发模式的广泛关注。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT女性用户占比首超50%且总用户规模逼近10亿大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d94ae718c271947526bf3fae3a9e6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI最新数据显示，ChatGPT用户性别结构发生历史性逆转，女性用户占比已突破50%，相较2022年发布初期的20%实现大幅增长，目前全球约有近5亿女性定期使用该工具，ChatGPT总用户规模正逼近10亿大关。在算力基础设施方面，OpenAI扩张势头强劲，其可用算力从2023年的0.2吉瓦提升至2025年的约1.9吉瓦，两年间年增幅约3倍。为应对下一阶段AI竞争，OpenAI已与英伟达等合作伙伴签署超30吉瓦的算力协议，计划在2030年前将算力规模提升至30吉瓦。用户结构的多元化与算力储备的持续加码，标志着ChatGPT在消费端普及度与底层基础设施支撑能力上均进入新阶段。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
